<!-- atrium synthetic fixture - not anybody's metadata.
     Five levels of ten: 10^5 expansions of a two-character string, so a parser that expands
     this produces about 200 KB from 400 bytes. Deliberately modest - the point is that the
     growth is exponential, not that this file can exhaust a machine. -->
